# Beats — the social floor (Chatters props + the Troll King)
#
# Engagement is currency here. Most of it is harmless karma — but a
# ratio or a pile-on draws the Algorithm's eye, so the loud ones route
# through `lockdown` like everything else that raises heat.

# The Troll King dares a newcomer into a fight.
== troll_dare(guest)
  cast: Troll_King, guest
  TROLL_KING
    Heh. Fresh packet. Bet you won't ratio the Mods.
  * Light them up
    <set: guest.heat += 25>
    <set: guest.karma += 10>
    <set: Troll_King.trusts.guest += 10>
    <if: guest.faction == null>
      <join: guest to Chatters>
    -> lockdown
  * Stay above it
    <set: guest.karma += 5>
    <set: Troll_King.trusts.guest -= 5>

# Smash the giant Like button. Pure dopamine, mostly harmless.
== smash_like(guest)
  cast: Like_Button, guest
  LIKE_BUTTON
    A giant glowing thumb, warm to the touch. It wants to be pressed.
  * SMASH that like
    <set: guest.posts += 1>
    <set: guest.karma += 5>
    <broadcast: applause to participant(guest)>
  + Smash it again, harder
    <set: guest.posts += 1>
    <set: guest.score += 5>

# The comment section: someone is wrong on the internet.
== comment_war(guest)
  cast: Comment_Section, guest
  COMMENT_SECTION
    The replies are a war zone. Someone is extremely, gloriously wrong.
  * Pile on
    <set: guest.posts += 1>
    <set: guest.heat += 20>
    <if: guest.faction == Chatters>
      The Chatters chant your name. Clout acquired.
      <set: guest.karma += 10>
    -> lockdown
  * Touch grass
    <set: guest.karma += 8>

# Ring the bell. Never miss a moment of the noise.
== subscribe(guest)
  cast: Notification_Bell, guest
  NOTIFICATION_BELL
    Ring the bell. Never miss a single second of the chaos.
  * Subscribe + all notifications
    <set: guest.posts += 1>
    <broadcast: subscribed to participant(guest)>
  + Mute everything
    <set: guest.karma += 3>
